### Netcup SCP API — Server Advanced
# Server logs, guest agent, GPU driver, rescue system, and storage optimization.

### Get Server Logs
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/logs
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get Server Logs with Pagination
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/logs?limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get Guest Agent Data
# QEMU guest agent data (network, OS info, filesystem)
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/guest-agent
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get GPU Driver Download URL
# Returns presigned S3 download URL for vGPU driver (if available)
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/gpu-driver
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get Rescue System Status
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/rescuesystem
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Activate Rescue System (async — returns task UUID)
POST {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/rescuesystem
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Deactivate Rescue System (async — returns task UUID)
DELETE {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/rescuesystem
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Optimize Storage (async — returns task UUID)
# Optional query params: ?disks=vda&startAfterOptimization=true
POST {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/storageoptimization
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
